(7681666, 1256977, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice different interpretation of "from above", but the challenge description was "Photograph any subject from a vantage point above it." Also the image shows strange post-processing effect with parts sharp followed by parts blurred and then sharp again, with clear boundaries in between, as if you used a blur brush on some parts but not on others.</td>', 'Nice different interpretation of "from above", but the challenge description was "Photograph any subject from a vantage point above it." Also the image shows strange post-processing effect with parts sharp followed by parts blurred and then sharp again, with clear boundaries in between, as if you used a blur brush on some parts but not on others.', '2020-12-17 03:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7681667, 1257187, 4008, '<td valign="top">Must have been a beautiful image before. I hate the processing. It is now more about the effect  than it is about the image. Does it fit within standard editing?</td>', 'Must have been a beautiful image before. I hate the processing. It is now more about the effect  than it is about the image. Does it fit within standard editing?', '2020-12-17 03:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
