(7682164, 1256999, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, although I find the cracks in the white paint distract from the people, and result in the image feeling rather busy.</td>', 'I like this a lot, although I find the cracks in the white paint distract from the people, and result in the image feeling rather busy.', '2020-12-22 17:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682165, 1256991, 104230, '<td valign="top">I especially love where the bicycle wheel "meets" its shadow!!  This is the kind of image I was hoping to see, 100% from above.  The empty space, the rectangular slabs and the three rectangles on the left nicely complement the objects and their shadows.</td>', 'I especially love where the bicycle wheel "meets" its shadow!!  This is the kind of image I was hoping to see, 100% from above.  The empty space, the rectangular slabs and the three rectangles on the left nicely complement the objects and their shadows.', '2020-12-22 17:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682199, 1257035, 173844, '<td valign="top">So much that''s perfect here - the composition, the lovely receding arc, the delicate blues, the focus about the bend, the following shadow, the artful blur and the overall finesse and precision.  Enough to unburden one.                                <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'So much that''s perfect here - the composition, the lovely receding arc, the delicate blues, the focus about the bend, the following shadow, the artful blur and the overall finesse and precision.  Enough to unburden one.                                Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-12-22 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682200, 1257221, 173844, '<td valign="top">Elated to see that such silver streams thread their way through verdant, unclenched mountains.  You''ve given us this majesty that''s beyond utterance.  The sun-filled atmosphere is overwhelming.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge, by a hair.</td>', 'Elated to see that such silver streams thread their way through verdant, unclenched mountains.  You''ve given us this majesty that''s beyond utterance.  The sun-filled atmosphere is overwhelming.Personal second favorite of the challenge, by a hair.', '2020-12-22 23:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682201, 1257026, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a pleasing composition.  The plowed roads and driveways make a mesmerizing pattern.  The rooftops are like buttons, the trees like stars.  What new universe is this?  Take me to your leader.</td>', 'What a pleasing composition.  The plowed roads and driveways make a mesmerizing pattern.  The rooftops are like buttons, the trees like stars.  What new universe is this?  Take me to your leader.', '2020-12-22 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682202, 1257251, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dizzying, compelling overhead shot.  Hypnotic, actually, as we seem to sail above this busy pittance.  Astounding, really.</td>', 'Dizzying, compelling overhead shot.  Hypnotic, actually, as we seem to sail above this busy pittance.  Astounding, really.', '2020-12-22 23:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682203, 1257242, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key study.  Your modest shapes, composed as they are, are casually, gently dynamic.  This is a master lesson.  The dish casts a wonderful shadow.</td>', 'Lovely high key study.  Your modest shapes, composed as they are, are casually, gently dynamic.  This is a master lesson.  The dish casts a wonderful shadow.', '2020-12-22 23:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
