(7682255, 1257220, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations<br/>Yours was my favorite. A beautiful and different take for the challenge.<br/>Stunning and I love the choice of BW<br/>Personally, I love the way you framed it.</td>', 'CongratulationsYours was my favorite. A beautiful and different take for the challenge.Stunning and I love the choice of BWPersonally, I love the way you framed it.', '2020-12-23 07:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7682256, 1257026, 19825, '<td valign="top">It is easy to get lost in this. The snow provides such nice contrast. I had hoped for some snow when I was planning to get the drone out for the challenge, but Chicago has had almost none this year. Nicely done.</td>', 'It is easy to get lost in this. The snow provides such nice contrast. I had hoped for some snow when I was planning to get the drone out for the challenge, but Chicago has had almost none this year. Nicely done.', '2020-12-23 07:53:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7682262, 1257187, 30049, '<td valign="top">I thought this was an interesting end product, but didn''t see how this was "above" anything - more of a side view of the castle.  So you probably got dinged on voting from both aspects.  However, I disagree with roz in that you weren''t "slaughtered", this image placed 25th out of 62.  Placing higher than 60% of other entries isn''t terrible, perhaps not up to expectations, but still "ok-ish" (is that a word?).  :-)<br/> <br/>I''ll be watching with interest as to how this plays out with the requested validation.</td>', 'I thought this was an interesting end product, but didn''t see how this was "above" anything - more of a side view of the castle.  So you probably got dinged on voting from both aspects.  However, I disagree with roz in that you weren''t "slaughtered", this image placed 25th out of 62.  Placing higher than 60% of other entries isn''t terrible, perhaps not up to expectations, but still "ok-ish" (is that a word?).  :-) I''ll be watching with interest as to how this plays out with the requested validation.', '2020-12-23 10:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7682270, 1257178, 123833, '<td valign="top">This is an image for National Geographic, Roz. Maybe try to enter it in some nature contests? Absolutely amazing! And he is looking up on you!!! Shame on the voters!! So short-sighted and so focused on finding a reason for low voting on such an outstanding image. <br/> <br/>PS I didn''t vote on this challenge and many recent challenges so this is my first reaction.<br/> <br/>PS2 He is smiling at you! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-12-23 12:05:29.</i></td>', 'This is an image for National Geographic, Roz. Maybe try to enter it in some nature contests? Absolutely amazing! And he is looking up on you!!! Shame on the voters!! So short-sighted and so focused on finding a reason for low voting on such an outstanding image.  PS I didn''t vote on this challenge and many recent challenges so this is my first reaction. PS2 He is smiling at you! :)', '2020-12-23 12:03:57.000000', '2020-12-23 12:05:29.000000', 0),
